<header id=3D"title-block-header" class=3D"quarto-title-block default">
<div class=3D"quarto-title">
<h1 class=3D"title">Friction and Coordination in Schooling: Transactional T=
eaching, Relational Work, and the Limits of Educational Efficiency</h1>
</div>



<div class=3D"quarto-title-meta">

    <div>
    <div class=3D"quarto-title-meta-heading">Author</div>
    <div class=3D"quarto-title-meta-contents">
             <p>Zia Hassan </p>
          </div>
  </div>
   =20
    <div>
    <div class=3D"quarto-title-meta-heading">Published</div>
